; DATA values that start positive are string lengths (0-32766) or
; integer prefixes (32767). Negative starts sift out as follows:
; -0 (-32768) to 4095: negated float exponents; -4096 to -32766:
; short integers (values -3000 to 25670) - negate & subtract 7096
; for actual value; -32767 End of DATA.
