;
; If either operand of TIMES_FLOAT is a power of 2, the result is produced
; by fiddling with the exponent of the other operand. There's no check for
; multiplication by zero at present, on the assumption that the ROM must
; detect this pretty quickly, and it's not worth holding ALL multiplication
; up to check both operands for zero.
; ** GWJ, but there is a problem when multiplying a power of 2 by zero since
; it is possible to end up with an invalid exponent, then overflow is detected.
; Hence modifications below.
;
